edecessor-version":[{"id":231216,"href":"https:\/\/insuranceasianews.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/231202\/revisions\/231216"}],"wp:featuredmedia":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/insuranceasianews.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media\/231203"}],"wp:attachment":[{"href":"https:\/\/insuranceasianews.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media?parent=231202"}],"wp:term":[{"taxonomy":"companies_category","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/insuranceasianews.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/companies_category?post=231202"},{"taxonomy":"subject","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/insuranceasianews.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/subject?post=231202"},{"taxonomy":"line_of_business","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/insuranceasianews.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/line_of_business?post=231202"},{"taxonomy":"topic","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/insuranceasianews.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/topic?post=231202"},{"taxonomy":"author","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/insuranceasianews.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/coauthors?post=231202"}],"curies":[{"name":"wp","href":"https:\/\/api.w.org\/{rel}","templated":true}]}},{"id":231207,"date":"2026-10-16T17:06:27","date_gmt":"2026-10-16T09:06:27","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/insuranceasianews.com\/?p=231207"},"modified":"2026-10-16T17:06:27","modified_gmt":"2026-10-16T09:06:27","slug":"zurich-allianz-jd-howden-mclarens-8-apac-insurance-people-moves-of-the-week","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/insuranceasianews.com\/zurich-allianz-jd-howden-mclarens-8-apac-insurance-people-moves-of-the-week\/","title":{"rendered":"Zurich, Allianz JD, Howden, McLarens: 8 APAC insurance people moves of the week"},"content":{"rendered":"<p>InsuranceAsia News wraps up the people moves from the insurance industry in Asia this week.<\/p>\n<h2 class=\"news-title\">1. Zurich names China unit CEO, greater China CFO<\/h2>\n<p><strong>Zurich Insurance<\/strong> has named <strong>Scott Yin<\/strong> as CEO of its China unit.<\/p>\n<p>Yin will take charge of the growth of Zurich\u2019s commercial insurance business and the ongoing expansion of its retail business, including Zurich Cover-More, its Travel Guard offering in the Chinese Market.<\/p>\n<p>Zurich Insurance has handed Hong Kong CFO <strong>Martin Noble<\/strong> an additional role as chief financial officer for greater China.<\/p>\n<p>In the expanded role, Noble will be responsible for strengthening collaboration between Zurich&#8217;s \u00a0Hong Kong and China finance teams, enhancing coordination in financial management, accounting and treasury activities.<\/p>\n<p><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0px;\">Read the full story <a href=\"https:\/\/insuranceasianews.com\/zurich-taps-scott-yin-as-china-unit-ceo\/\">here<\/a> and <a href=\"https:\/\/insuranceasianews.com\/zurich-appoints-martin-noble-to-expanded-role-as-greater-china-cfo\/\">here<\/a>.<\/span><\/p>\n<h2 class=\"news-title\">2. Allianz Jingdong appoints new CEO<\/h2>\n<p><strong>John Chen<\/strong> has replaced <strong>William Liang<\/strong> as chief executive officer for <strong>Allianz Jingdong General Insurance (Allianz JD)<\/strong>, the German insurer\u2019s joint venture in China with Chinese e-commerce firm JD.com.<\/p>\n<p>Liang left Allianz JD on Thursday to pursue new opportunities, while Chen\u2019s appointment is effective from Friday.<\/p>\n<p><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0px;\">Read the full story<\/span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0px;\">\u00a0<a href=\"https:\/\/insuranceasianews.com\/john-chen-succeeds-william-liang-as-allianz-jingdong-ceo\/\">here<\/a>.<\/span><\/p>\n<h2 class=\"news-title\">3. Howden Australia builds out sport, entertainment practice, appoints Pacific head of technical, claims<\/h2>\n<p class=\"news-title\"><strong>Howden<\/strong> Australia has added five senior ex-Marsh brokers to grow its sport and entertainment practice, which it called \u201ca significant investment in the sector.\u201d<\/p>\n<p><strong>Simon Calabrese<\/strong> has been appointed as head of leisure and entertainment, while <strong>Lauren Coburn<\/strong>, <strong>Sarah Collin<\/strong>, <strong>Melissa Fitzsimmons<\/strong> and <strong>James Schubach<\/strong> have been tapped as senior associates for the division.<\/p>\n<p>Gold Coast-based Calabrese brings over two decades of experience in the business line, including eight years at Marsh and JLT and 16 years at Aon.<\/p>\n<p><strong>Catherine Osbourne<\/strong> has been named as the firm&#8217;s new head of technical and claims in the Pacific.<\/p>\n<p>Sydney-based Osbourne has joined Howden from Marsh, where she was chief claims officer for the Pacific region from January 2022 until April.<\/p>\n<p><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0px;\">Read the full story<\/span> <span style=\"letter-spacing: 0px;\"><a href=\"https:\/\/insuranceasianews.com\/howden-australia-drafts-marsh-team-for-sport-and-entertainment-practice-build-out\/\">here<\/a> and <a href=\"https:\/\/insuranceasianews.com\/howden-australia-appoints-catherine-osbourne-as-pacific-head-of-technical-claims\/\">here<\/a>.<\/span><\/p>\n<h2 class=\"news-title\">4. McLarens\u2019 adjuster swaps Sydney for Singapore, handed regional role <img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-thumbnail wp-image-231190 alignleft\" src=\"https:\/\/insuranceasianews.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/Nathan-Baran-150x150.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\" srcset=\"https:\/\/insuranceasianews.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/Nathan-Baran-150x150.png 150w, https:\/\/insuranceasianews.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/Nathan-Baran-300x300.png 300w, https:\/\/insuranceasianews.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/Nathan-Baran-1024x1024.png 1024w, https:\/\/insuranceasianews.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/Nathan-Baran-768x767.png 768w, https:\/\/insuranceasianews.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/Nathan-Baran.png 1043w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 991px) 100vw, (max-width: 1549px) 65vw, 984px\" \/><\/h2>\n<p><strong>McLarens<\/strong> has appointed <strong>Nathan Baran<\/strong> as regional loss adjuster, based in Singapore.<\/p>\n<p>Baran has relocated from Sydney, where he was most recently an executive liability loss adjuster since April 2025.<\/p>\n<p><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0px;\">Read the full story<\/span>\u00a0<a style=\"letter-spacing: 0px;\" href=\"https:\/\/insuranceasianews.com\/mclarens-nathan-baran-swaps-sydney-for-singapore-named-regional-loss-adjuster\/\">here.<\/a><\/p>\n<h2 class=\"news-title\">5. BMS Group taps executive broker in New Zealand<\/h2>\n<p>Global broker <strong>BMS Group<\/strong> has appointed <strong>Grant Robertson<\/strong> as an executive broker within its New Zealand business.<\/p>\n<p>Robertson joins from Donaldson Brown in Auckland, where he spent over eight years in roles including head of financial lines and international placements and head of complex risks.<\/p>\n<p><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0px;\">Read the full story<\/span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0px;\">\u00a0<\/span><a style=\"letter-spacing: 0px;\" href=\"https:\/\/insuranceasianews.com\/bms-group-taps-grant-robertson-as-executive-broker\/\">here.<\/a><\/p>\n<h2 class=\"news-title\">6. Parametric specialist IBISA appoints India CEO<\/h2>\n<p>Luxembourg-headquartered parametric insurtech <strong>IBISA<\/strong> has appointed <strong>Samdarshi Vikram Singh<\/strong> as CEO for India to drive its next growth phase.<\/p>\n<p>Singh joins from Generali Central, where he has worked for nearly a decade, most recently as the head of government business and reinsurance.<\/p>\n<p><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0px;\">Read the full story<\/span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0px;\">\u00a0<a href=\"https:\/\/insuranceasianews.com\/parametric-insurer-ibisa-appoints-samdarshi-vikram-singh-as-ceo-for-india\/\">here<\/a>.<\/span><\/p>\n<h2 class=\"news-title\">7. Allianz Australia hires senior liability underwriter <img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignright size-thumbnail wp-image-231191\" src=\"https:\/\/insuranceasianews.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/Stephanie-Roth-150x150.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\" srcset=\"https:\/\/insuranceasianews.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/Stephanie-Roth-150x150.png 150w, https:\/\/insuranceasianews.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/Stephanie-Roth-300x300.png 300w, https:\/\/insuranceasianews.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/Stephanie-Roth-1024x1024.png 1024w, https:\/\/insuranceasianews.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/Stephanie-Roth-768x767.png 768w, https:\/\/insuranceasianews.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/Stephanie-Roth.png 1043w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 991px) 100vw, (max-width: 1549px) 65vw, 984px\" \/><\/h2>\n<p><strong>Stephanie Roth<\/strong> has rejoined <strong>Allianz Australia<\/strong> as a senior liability underwriter.<\/p>\n<p>Perth-based Roth joins from Liberty Specialty Markets, where she spent over five years, most recently as a senior casualty underwriter since October 2024.<\/p>\n<p><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0px;\">Read the full story <a href=\"https:\/\/insuranceasianews.com\/stephanie-roth-rejoins-allianz-australia-as-senior-liability-underwriter\/\">here<\/a>.<\/span><\/p>\n<h2 class=\"news-title\">8. Generali Central Insurance appoints CFO<\/h2>\n<p><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0px;\"><strong>Generali Central Insurance<\/strong> has appointed <strong>Chandraprakash Jain<\/strong> as chief financial officer (designate).\u00a0<\/span><\/p>\n<p>Mumbai-based Jain has over two decades of experience across finance, insurance, accounting, strategic planning, mergers and acquisitions, and business operations.<\/p>\n<p><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0px;\">Read the full story<\/span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0px;\">\u00a0<a href=\"https:\/\/insuranceasianews.com\/generali-central-insurance-appoints-chandraprakash-jain-as-cfo\/\">here<\/a>.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><em>For more InsuranceAsia News (IAN) people moves at brokers, insurers, reinsurers, insurtechs, specialty players, MGAs and loss adjusters across Asia Pacific\u2019s fast-growing (re)insurance markets click\u00a0<a href=\"https:\/\/insuranceasianews.com\/post_category\/people\/\">here<\/a>.<\/em><\/p>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>BMS Group, IBISA, Allianz and Generali Central Insurance also made personnel changes over the last week.<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":11026,"featured_media":231193,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","sticky":false,"template":"","format":"standard","meta":{"_acf_changed":false,"content-type":"","footnotes":""},"companies_category":[],"subject":[],"line_of_business":[],"topic":[],"coauthors":[882],"class_list":["post-231207","post","type-post","status-publish","format-standard","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","post_category-people-moves","post_category-whitelist"],"acf":[],"yoast_head":"<!-- This site is optimized with the Yoast SEO plugin v28.6 - https:\/\/yoast.com\/product\/yoast-seo-wordpress\/ -->\n<title>Zurich, Allianz JD, Howden, McLarens: 8 APAC insurance people moves of the week<\/title>\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"The key resource for accurate, insightful and reliable coverage of Asia\u2019s insurance and reinsurance market.\" \/>\n<meta name=\"robots\" content=\"index, follow, max-snippet:-1, max-image-preview:large, max-video-preview:-1\" \/>\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https:\/\/insuranceasianews.com\/zurich-allianz-jd-howden-mclarens-8-apac-insurance-people-moves-of-the-week\/\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:locale\" content=\"en_US\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"article\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Zurich, Allianz JD, Howden, McLarens: 8 APAC insurance people moves of the week\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"The key resource for accurate, insightful and reliable coverage of Asia\u2019s insurance and reinsurance market.\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:url\" content=\"https:\/\/insuranceasianews.com\/zurich-allianz-jd-howden-mclarens-8-apac-insurance-people-moves-of-the-week