s pl...<\/p>\n  <\/div>\n  <div class=\"mepr-unauthorized-message\">\n    <div class=\"mepr-wrapper\">\n<p>To continue reading the full article and get full access to the InsuranceAsia News platform, please enquire about a subscription.<\/p>\n<p>Your company may already have a corporate license in place.<\/p>\n<div class=\"mepr-button-wrap\">\n<p><a href=\"https:\/\/insuranceasianews.com\/subscribe\/\">Enquire Now<\/a><\/p>\n<div>OR<\/div>\n<p>      <a href=\"https:\/\/insuranceasianews.com\/register\/free-trial\/\" class=\"mepr_product_link mepr-product-link-63661\">Take a Free Trial<\/a>\n        <\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p>Already a Subscriber? Please <a href=\"https:\/\/insuranceasianews.com\/login\/\">Login<\/a><\/p>\n<\/div>\n  <\/div>\n  <div class=\"mepr-login-form-wrap\">\n      <\/div>\n<\/div>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Application will be considered during the coming months, but will not impact the 2027 renewals.<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":9598,"featured_media":231051,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","sticky":false,"template":"","format":"standard","meta":{"_acf_changed":false,"content-type":"","footnotes":""},"companies_category":[1031,608],"subject":[],"line_of_business":[864],"topic":[],"coauthors":[731],"class_list":["post-231045","post","type-post","status-publish","format-standard","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","industry_segments-insurers","country-china","companies_category-china-pi","companies_category-international-group-of-pi-clubs","line_of_business-pi-marine"],"acf":[],"yoast_head":"<!-- This site is optimized with the Yoast SEO plugin v28.6 - https:\/\/yoast.com\/product\/yoast-seo-wordpress\/ -->\n<title>China P&amp;I formally applies to join International Group of P&amp;I Clubs<\/title>\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"The key resource for accurate, insightful and reliable coverage of Asia\u2019s insurance and reinsurance market.\" \/>\n<meta name=\"robots\" content=\"index, follow, max-snippet:-1,