5T04:21:30","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/insuranceasianews.com\/?p=231037"},"modified":"2026-10-15T17:49:50","modified_gmt":"2026-10-15T09:49:50","slug":"west-of-england-faces-pi-claims-after-singapore-registered-container-vessel-sinks-in-strait-of-hormuz","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/insuranceasianews.com\/west-of-england-faces-pi-claims-after-singapore-registered-container-vessel-sinks-in-strait-of-hormuz\/","title":{"rendered":"Singapore-flagged container vessel sunk in Strait of Hormuz &#8216;matter for war risk underwriters&#8217;, West says"},"content":{"rendered":"<div class=\"mp_wrapper\">\n  <div class=\"mepr-unauthorized-excerpt\">\n    <p>A Singapore-flagged container vessel which sank after being struck by an unknown projectile while transiting the Strait of Hormuz was entered with P&amp;I insurer West of England, but is a \"matter for...<\/p>\n  <\/div>\n  <div class=\"mepr-unauthorized-message\">\n    <div class=\"mepr-wrapper\">\n<p>To continue reading the full article and get full access to the InsuranceAsia News platform, please enquire about a subscription.<\/p>\n<p>Your company may already have a corporate license in place.<\/p>\n<div class=\"mepr-button-wrap\">\n<p><a href=\"https:\/\/insuranceasianews.com\/subscribe\/\">Enquire Now<\/a><\/p>\n<div>OR<\/div>\n<p>      <a href=\"https:\/\/insuranceasianews.com\/register\/free-trial\/\" class=\"mepr_product_link mepr-product-link-63661\">Take a Free Trial<\/a>\n        <\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p>Already a Subscriber? Please <a href=\"https:\/\/insuranceasianews.com\/login\/\">Login<\/a><\/p>\n<\/div>\n  <\/div>\n  <div class=\"mepr-login-form-wrap\">\n      <\/div>\n<\/div>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>GFS Pride was struck by an unknown projectile, although all 21 crew members were safely evacuated and no injuries have been reported, according to the Maritime and Port Authority of Singapore.<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":10143,"featured_media":140438,"comment